NIA_HTML='''<section class="source-ledger" id="nia-submission-workbook"><h2>NIA project changes · submission workbook rows</h2><p class="lede">This is a row-level view of the new FY 2027 NIA workbook’s NEP and HGAB columns. It adds the workbook’s NEP, HGAB, and NIA-submission amounts, project-count fields, edited markers, and justifications to the PDF-based review above. The workbook itself is headed “For submission to Senate”; entries are a submission-stage cross-check, not a replacement for the visible bill schedule.</p><div class="source-metrics" id="nia-workbook-metrics"></div><p class="source-note">Blank NEP cells remain blank; they are not treated as zero. Different submission wording can reflect a correction, a scope or location change, or revised wording. This table does not certify that two rows describe the same engineering scope. Amounts are shown by project-level rows and are not agency-wide totals.</p><div class="source-controls"><input id="nia-workbook-search" type="search" placeholder="Search project, region, province, or justification" aria-label="Search NIA workbook rows"><select id="nia-workbook-filter" aria-label="Filter NIA workbook rows"><option value="all">All workbook project rows</option><option value="delta">Non-zero allocation change</option><option value="text">NEP / NIA submission text differs</option><option value="blank">NEP amount is blank</option><option value="zero">NEP amount is zero</option><option value="same">No amount change and same text</option></select><button type="button" id="nia-workbook-export">Export filtered CSV</button></div><div class="data-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Program / place</th><th>NEP project title</th><th>NIA submission title</th><th>NEP amount</th><th>HGAB amount</th><th>NIA submission amount</th><th>NEP → HGAB variance</th><th>Edited</th><th>Justification</th><th>Workbook row</th></tr></thead><tbody id="nia-workbook-body"></tbody></table></div><div class="source-pager"><button type="button" id="nia-workbook-prev">Previous</button><span id="nia-workbook-page"></span><button type="button" id="nia-workbook-next">Next</button></div><p><a class="source-link" href="nia-submission-workbook.json" download>Download all extracted workbook rows as JSON ↗</a></p></section>'''

