FMR_HTML='''<section class="fmr-new-ledger" id="fmr-new-source-data"><h2>DA FMR working draft and GEOAGRI proposal records</h2><p class="source-intro">The November 5 working draft adds 960 control-numbered FMR entries, proposed amounts, coordinate or title revisions, and remarks to the House schedule view. The draft is shown as its own snapshot; it is not treated as enacted or final. Use “Check GEOAGRI” on an entry to search the public proposal API for possible related records.</p><div class="source-metrics" id="fmr-draft-metrics"></div><p class="source-warning"><strong>Interpretation:</strong> a matching road name or municipality is a candidate link, not proof that the draft and GEOAGRI records refer to the same project. The November workbook and GEOAGRI have different purposes and evaluation stages. Draft coordinates are kept in the source text; the API result provides estimated length, width, cost, counterpart amount, and WGS 84 geometry.</p><h3>GEOAGRI FMR proposals · live search</h3><p>Public GET API, no authentication. Search supports road name, FMR code, region, province, district, municipality, and barangay; status can be filtered. A current list response reported 32,689 proposals on 11 November 2026. Search makes one request when submitted (rate limit: 60 list requests per minute).</p><form id="geoagri-search-form" class="source-controls"><input id="geoagri-query" maxlength="100" placeholder="Road name, FMR code, municipality, barangay (max 100 characters)" aria-label="Search GEOAGRI proposals"><select id="geoagri-status" aria-label="GEOAGRI evaluation status"><option value="">All statuses</option><option>FOR EVALUATION</option><option>EVALUATED</option></select><input id="geoagri-province" maxlength="100" placeholder="Exact province filter" aria-label="Filter GEOAGRI by province"><input id="geoagri-municipality" maxlength="100" placeholder="Exact municipality filter" aria-label="Filter GEOAGRI by municipality"><button type="submit">Search proposals</button></form><div class="api-results" id="geoagri-results" aria-live="polite">Search the public GEOAGRI proposals to load matching records.</div><h3>November 5 draft changes · all 960 control numbers</h3><div class="source-controls"><input id="fmr-draft-search" type="search" placeholder="Search control number, project text, coordinates, or remarks" aria-label="Search FMR draft rows"><select id="fmr-draft-filter" aria-label="Filter FMR draft rows"><option value="all">All draft rows</option><option value="new">New control number</option><option value="retain">Marked RETAIN</option><option value="zero">Proposed amount is zero</option><option value="text">From / to text differs</option><option value="geo">Coordinate or GPS remark</option></select><button type="button" id="fmr-draft-export">Export filtered CSV</button></div><div class="data-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Control</th><th>From · existing project text</th><th>To · proposed project text</th><th>Current draft amount</th><th>Proposed increase</th><th>Proposed decrease</th><th>Proposed amount</th><th>Remarks</th><th>API lookup</th></tr></thead><tbody id="fmr-draft-body"></tbody></table></div><div class="source-pager"><button type="button" id="fmr-draft-prev">Previous</button><span id="fmr-draft-page"></span><button type="button" id="fmr-draft-next">Next</button></div><p><a class="source-link" href="fmr-nov5-working-draft.json" download>Download all extracted November 5 draft rows as JSON ↗</a></p></section>'''

